Added with Paper 025 (2026-11-17): foundations
1.3.291-1.3.302 — algebraic curve; rational point;
the Galois group; Galois cohomology; p-adic
numbers; abelian variety; the Jacobian; the
pro-unipotent fundamental group; the Selmer group;
